WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Why?

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Because these are the issues governments consider closest to their sovereignty.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
No country wants to be forced into a tax policy or a military alliance

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
it never actually agreed to.
